{"unit":17,"section":2,"cefr":"A1","objective":"discuss colors","skill":"Colors","heading":"Discuss colors","phrases":[{"he":"הכובע שלי צהוב.","en":"My hat is yellow.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/6697735f3ac6cc15c7c2de96523b8392","tokens":[{"w":"הכובע","h":["the hat is","the hat"]},{"w":"שלי","h":["my","mine"]},{"w":"צהוב","h":["yellow (sg. masc.)"]}]},{"he":"אני רוצָה צעיף ירוק.","en":"I want a green scarf.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/e981a24450ab151fd226d726d71b8e1c","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I","I am","me"]},{"w":"רוצָה","h":["want","wants"]},{"w":"צעיף","h":["a scarf","scarf"]},{"w":"ירוק","h":["green"]}]},{"he":"הוא לובש מכנסיים סגולים.","en":"He is wearing purple pants.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/8576ee8b34ce8ef6033790347514d3dc","tokens":[{"w":"הוא","h":["(he) is","he","(it) is"]},{"w":"לובש","h":["is wearing","wears","wear"]},{"w":"מכנסיים","h":["pants","trousers"]},{"w":"סגולים","h":["purple (pl. masc.)"]}]},{"he":"אני צובעת ביצה.","en":"I am painting an egg.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/396373fd5a0fc01baf6473c866fa69ca","tokens":[{"w":"אני","h":["I am","I","me"]},{"w":"צובעת","h":["is painting","paint","color"]},{"w":"ביצה","h":["an egg","egg"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"רוצָה","en":"want","alt":["wants"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הכובע","en":"the hat","alt":["the hat is"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"לובש","en":"is wearing","alt":["wear","wears"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"צהוב","en":"yellow (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"צעיף","en":"scarf","alt":["a scarf"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ירוק","en":"green","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"סגולים","en":"purple (pl. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"צובעת","en":"color","alt":["is painting","paint"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"ביצה","en":"an egg","alt":["egg"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"שלי","en":"my","alt":["mine"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"אני","en":"I am","alt":["I","me"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"הוא","en":"he","alt":["(he) is","(it) is"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"מכנסיים","en":"pants","alt":["trousers"],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["לצבוע","הירוק","צהוב","כחול","ורוד","צבעוני","ירוק","כחולים","צובעת","צבעונית","האפור","צובע","צהובים","אפורה","כתום","ורודים","ירוקים","צבעונים","כתומים"],"tips":"Many colors in Hebrew fit the following pattern, in which the masculine singular includes the vowel \"o\", while the other conjugations include the vowel \"u\".\n\no -> u pattern:\n---\nUsing סגול (purple) as an example:\n\n|masculine singular|feminine singular|masculine/mixed plural|feminine plural|\n|:-----|------|------:|  \n|סגול|סגולה|סגולים|סגולות|\n|sagól|sgulá|sgulím|sgulót|\n\n---------\nThe colors black (שחור shakhór) and gray (אפור afór) follow a slightly different pattern, in which the \"o\" sound **doesn't** change to an \"u\" sound in the plural and  feminine singular conjugations:\n\no -> o pattern:\n---\nUsing שחור as an example:  \n\n|masculine singular|feminine singular|masculine/mixed plural|feminine plural|\n|:-----|-----|------:|  \n|שחור|שחורה|שחורים|שחורות|\n|shakhór|shkhorá|shkhorím|shkhorót|"}